  <p id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">鄱陽王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p001:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_A">伯山</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p001:m0006" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_A">靜之</persName>，世祖第三子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">衡陽王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_B">伯信</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002:m0006" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_B">孚之</persName>，世祖第七子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">永陽王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p003:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_C">伯智</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p003:m0006" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_C">策之</persName>，世祖第十二子也。</p>
